## description of what was run, for what purpose
Modal GPU run of `modal_gguf_vlm_export.py::run` to validate GGUF export for Qwen2-VL-2B-Instruct (vision model) using local unsloth branch changes.
- Environment: Modal A10G, torch 2.5.1+cu121, unsloth installed editable from branch `gguf-vision-export`, unsloth_zoo==2025.11.5.
- Actions: downloaded model, merged to 16-bit, patched converter, converted text + mmproj to GGUF, quantized text to q8_0.
- Outputs: `Qwen2-VL-2B-Instruct.Q8_0.gguf` (~1.53 GB) and `Qwen2-VL-2B-Instruct.BF16-mmproj.gguf` (full-precision vision projector).
- Notes: build emitted warnings about missing `triton_kernels` and `causal_conv1d` compilation; conversion completed successfully with both GGUF artifacts produced.

